vertices of a polygon can point in diﬀerent directions. If yo u project texture coordinates from
diﬀerent directions at diﬀerent vertices and interpolate t he results, the result is likely to be a
mess. So, doing the computation in the fragment shader is saf er. Suppose that the interpolated
