The parameter to device.queue.submit() is an array of command buﬀers, although in this
case there is only one. (The command encoder cannot be reused ; if you want to submit multiple
command buﬀers, you will need to create a new command encoder for each one.)
Note that commands are submitted to the device queue. The submit() function returns
immediately after enqueueing the commands. They will be exe cuted in a separate process on
the GPU side of the application.
