When you deﬁne a function using a deﬁnition like the ones in th e examples shown above, it’s
almost the same as assigning a function to a variable. For exa mple, given the above deﬁnition
of the function sum, you can assign sum to a variable or pass it as a parameter, and you would
be assigning or passing the function. And if the value of a var iable is a function, you can use
