starts executing the program, the computer reads the entire program to ﬁnd all the function
deﬁnitions that it contains. Assignment statements, on the other hand, are executed when the
computer gets to them while executing the program.)
JavaScript even has something like “function literals.” Th at is, there is a way of writing a
