with a standard function deﬁnition. Such functions are call ed “anonymous functions.” There
are two syntaxes for anonymous functions. The older syntax l ooks like a function deﬁnition
without a name. Here, for example, an anonymous function is c reated and passed as the ﬁrst
parameter to a function named setTimeout:
